  - "b\u1EA1n t\xEAn g\xEC, b\u1EA1n mu\u1ED1n g\xEC, b\u1EA1n l\xE0 ai, xin ch\xE0o,
    b\u1EA1n \u0103n g\xEC ch\u01B0a, n\xF3i, th\u1EDDi nh\xE0 l\xFD, trang ph\u1EE5c
    nh\xE0 l\xFD,trang ph\u1EE5c th\u1EDDi nh\xE0 l\xFD, vi\u1EC7t nam c\xF3 bao
    nhi\xEAu trang ph\u1EE5c truy\u1EC1n th\u1ED1ng, trang ph\u1EE5c ti\u1EC1n l\u1EC7,
    trang ph\u1EE5c nh\xE0 tr\u1EA7n, th\u1EDDi nh\xE0 tr\u1EA7n, trang ph\u1EE5c
    nh\xE0 h\u1ED3, th\u1EDDi nh\xE0 h\u1ED3, trang ph\u1EE5c nh\xE0 nguy\u1EC5n,
    th\u1EDDi nh\xE0 nguy\u1EC5n, trang ph\u1EE5c t\xE2y s\u01A1n, th\u1EDDi t\xE2y
    s\u01A1n, trang ph\u1EE5c b\u1EAFc 1, th\u1EDDi b\u1EAFc 1, trang ph\u1EE5c b\u1EAFc
    2, th\u1EDDi b\u1EAFc 2, trang ph\u1EE5c h\u1ED3ng b\xE0n, th\u1EDDi h\u1ED3ng
    b\xE0n, trang ph\u1EE5c h\u1EADu l\xEA, th\u1EDDi h\u1EADu l\xEA, trang ph\u1EE5c
    tr\u1ECBnh nguy\u1EC5n, th\u1EDDi tr\u1ECBnh nguy\u1EC5n, trang ph\u1EE5c l\xEA
    trung h\u01B0ng, th\u1EDDi l\xEA trung h\u01B0ng, trang ph\u1EE5c nh\xE0 m\u1EA1c,
    th\u1EDDi nh\xE0 m\u1EA1c, trang ph\u1EE5c nh\xE0 ng\xF4, th\u1EDDi nh\xE0 ng\xF4,
    th\u1EDDi \xE2u l\u1EA1c,  trang ph\u1EE5c \xE2u l\u1EA1c, trang ph\u1EE5c th\u1EDDi
    nh\xE0 \u0111inh, th\u1EDDi nh\xE0 \u0111inh, trang ph\u1EE5c nh\xE0 \u0111inh            "
